<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment produced by Codex reconciliation. GMR English remains verbatim. thob bya owns the established HGM rendering retained by the hold; no thob/hold member is claimed, since the final hold is the explanatory retaining agent. las gnyis is an attested compound with karma and two members. The two intransitive arising forms behind English produce are omitted as distributed causal recasts, not nulled. The separate come occurrence retains its result-as-subject role. rang bzhin excludes supplied any. la lar/any given is a local contextual match, not an HGM glossary attestation. sogs owns the complete attested closing gesture or the like. Topic ni has no separate English exponent. The bracketed good/bad-deed explanation and other supplied participants and auxiliaries remain unwrapped. The synonymous or karma re-expression after deed is left unwrapped, banking las once.</div>
